# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Frequency Music — environment
#
# Secrets are managed by varlock + 1Password. The committed `.env.schema` files
# (root, web/, agent/) are the SOURCE OF TRUTH for every variable. Real secret
# values live in the `Country Manor Lab` 1Password vault and are resolved at
# runtime via varlock's op() resolver — never put a real secret in a committed
# file.
#
# This .env.example is only a reminder of what you may override locally.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# LOCAL DEV (Mac):
#   1. Install the 1Password desktop app + CLI; enable the CLI/biometric
#      integration (`op --version` should work).
#   2. `bun install`  (installs varlock + @varlock/1password-plugin)
#   3. Run scripts normally: `bun run scripts/<name>.ts`
#      varlock auto-loads, resolves secrets from 1Password (biometric prompt),
#      and validates against .env.schema.
#   Inspect resolved values: `bunx varlock load`
#
# CI / HEADLESS:
#   Set APP_ENV=ci and OP_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_TOKEN to a 1Password service-account
#   token.
#
# OPTIONAL LOCAL OVERRIDES → copy any of these into `.env.local` (gitignored).
# A literal here overrides the 1Password/op() value, so you can develop without
# 1Password if you paste values directly:
#
# APP_ENV=dev
# CONVEX_URL=https://convex.resonantprojects.art
# AUTH_BYPASS_SECRET=
# AGENT_TOOL_SECRET=
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# GROQ_API_KEY=
# NOTION_API_KEY=
# KERNEL_API_KEY=
# READWISE_TOKEN=
# INGEST_SHARED_SECRET=
# LANGSMITH_API_KEY=
